@{
    ViewBag.Title = "FAQ: Zion Market Research";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_LayoutInternal.cshtml";
    ViewBag.MetaDescription = "FAQ: Zion Market Research";
    ViewBag.MetaKeywords = "FAQ,Zion Market Research";
}
<section id="report-title" class="white_section section_gap">
    @{ Html.RenderPartial("_NewSearch"); }
    <div class="container">
        @{ Html.RenderPartial("_breadcrumb", "FAQ"); }

        <div class="col-md-8 white_section">
            <p>
                <strong class="underline">What is Zion Market Research?</strong><br />
                Zion Market Research is a well-known one-stop solution for all client research requirements regarding market research reports. We have a team of domain experts who provide unbiased insights on reports in order to fulfill our clients’ requirements.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong class="underline">
                    Why use Zion Market Research?
                </strong><br />
                Zion Market Research offers a complete and vast collection of competitive intelligence market research reports from number of global publishers. Our expertise has in-depth knowledge about the industry. We take care to satisfy our customers to the fullest by providing high-quality and timely reports, which makes us shine more as compared to our competitors.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong class="underline">
                    How do I purchase reports from Zion Market Research?
                </strong><br />
                One can begin with searching keyword relevant to the required market. Our search engine is designed in such a way that one searches for a keyword, all relevant results are displayed in one go. When the relevant results appear on the screen, click on the title to view the detailed information about the product that includes a descriptive summary and table of content. Purchasing on ordering the report online from the website is quite simple. Click on the Buy Now option and select the copy (single-user/multi-user) you prefer for. Simply follow the steps visible on the screen or call the number provided on our website for further assistance. You can also discuss with one of our industry-specific research specialists in case of any concerns. They can help you find the best suitable report meeting your requirement and help you answer any questions regarding your research.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong class="underline">
                    What type of research reports do you offer?
                </strong><br />
                Zion Market Research offers syndicated as well as customized market research reports, which include qualitative and quantitative research on various markets, companies, and industries. Length of the report ranges from 50 to 100 pages, including exhaustive company profiles, market forecasts, and market dynamics. Most reports are stand-alone studies that are available in PDF formats.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong class="underline">
                    How are the reports priced?
                </strong><br />
                The price of any research report depends on various factors such as length of the study, number of primary interviews to be conducted for completion of the study, availability of information via secondary research, and feasibility of the niche.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong class="underline">
                    What types of payment modes are accepted?
                </strong><br />
                For online purchase of market research reports, we accept Visa, American Express, Mastercard, Discover, and Diner’s Club cards.
                What is the difference between single-user, multi-user, and enterprise license?
                Detailed description of each type is provided below:
                <ul>
                    <li>The purchase of a 'Single-User License' grants access to a specific report for one person only and must not be shared with any other employee within the same company.</li>
                    <li>
                        The purchase of a 'Multi-User License’ grants access to a specific report for two to five users only within the same department and within the same company.
                    </li>
                    <li>The purchase of an 'Enterprise License’ grants access to a specific report to a company-wide audience. This includes subsidiary companies or other companies within a group of companies.</li>
                </ul>
            </p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 divtopmargin">
            @{ Html.RenderPartial("_contact"); }
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<style>
    .underline {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
    li{
        margin-left: 15px;
    }
</style>
@section metaTags{
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
}